BEHAVIOR env-get

DESCRIPTION
  Value of the environment variable named by the null-terminated `name` buffer,
  as a null-terminated byte buffer, plus found=1/0. Absent variable yields an
  empty value and found=0.

CONTRACT
  INPUT name bytes 256
  OUTPUT value bytes 65536
  OUTPUT found int 8
  GUARANTEES writes_output

HASH 02454929

NATIVE
